{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Hand to hand</b> — HaShem is before the hand of the wicked, therefore he will not be cleared. And the meaning: he will not be cleared, for HaShem will return his recompense upon his head." "<b>And the seed of the righteous</b> — they are the children of the righteous, who will escape trouble on account of their fathers."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:10.791895298Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}